WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 10]

02:04.980 --> 02:06.340
They came well-prepared.

02:06.700 --> 02:08.100
They mean to trap us like rats.

02:09.140 --> 02:09.660
Report!

02:11.380 --> 02:11.740
Report!

02:12.100 --> 02:13.420
The Northern Desert has stationed
1,500 troops at the North Gate.

02:13.580 --> 02:14.540
And at the East, West, and South Gates,

02:14.740 --> 02:15.420
500 troops each.

02:16.700 --> 02:17.180
Not many.

02:18.060 --> 02:19.060
Seriously?

02:19.580 --> 02:20.820
Wangcheng has only 500 garrison troops.

02:21.060 --> 02:22.140
How can we defeat 3,000 elite troops

02:22.340 --> 02:23.460
from the Northern Desert?

02:23.980 --> 02:24.980
The battle hasn't even begun.

02:24.980 --> 02:25.820
Stop spoiling the morale.

02:26.740 --> 02:27.620
Do you think the 300 soldiers

02:27.620 --> 02:29.540
I brought along are good for nothing?

02:29.660 --> 02:30.780
Wangcheng,

02:30.780 --> 02:32.060
sheltered by Yunzhong Prefecture,

02:32.060 --> 02:33.180
has grown soft.

02:33.460 --> 02:35.060
How could your defenses be this lax?

02:36.060 --> 02:37.420
Not even 800 could withstand 3,000.

02:37.500 --> 02:37.980
Nonsense.

02:39.540 --> 02:40.460
Those 800 soldiers

02:40.460 --> 02:41.620
could rout all 3,000 of them.

02:42.420 --> 02:43.860
If you disrupt morale again,

02:43.900 --> 02:44.700
I'll offer your head

02:44.740 --> 02:45.580
to our banner.

02:46.460 --> 02:47.540
So many troops crossed the border,

02:48.780 --> 02:50.140
yet not a single word leaked out?

02:50.500 --> 02:51.940
Who else could it be but Xiao Xun?

02:53.660 --> 02:54.940
He opened the gates

02:55.380 --> 02:56.140
to foreign aggression.

02:57.180 --> 02:58.380
Since they stationed 500 troops

02:58.620 --> 02:59.420
at the East, West, and South Gates each,

03:00.140 --> 03:01.380
as long as we concentrate our forces

03:01.620 --> 03:02.420
and break out from the South Gate,

03:02.780 --> 03:03.420
there is a chance

03:03.580 --> 03:04.540
to escort Your Highness out.

03:04.900 --> 03:05.580
Exactly, Zhao.

03:06.020 --> 03:07.540
Leave now, and we will hold the rear.

03:08.140 --> 03:08.740
Even at the cost of my life,

03:08.860 --> 03:09.820
I will get you out of the city.

03:10.140 --> 03:10.500
No.

03:10.820 --> 03:11.300
I cannot leave.

03:12.500 --> 03:13.860
We cannot let the people of Wangcheng

03:14.100 --> 03:15.500
fall victim to the enemy's blades.

03:16.380 --> 03:16.900
Nor can we

03:16.900 --> 03:17.980
let Xiao Xun's scheme succeed.

03:19.300 --> 03:20.780
Wangcheng lies behind Yunzhong.

03:21.340 --> 03:22.620
If the Northern Desert takes Wangcheng,

03:23.660 --> 03:24.300
the Lord of Xiaonan

03:24.580 --> 03:25.820
will surely seize the chance
to march.

03:26.420 --> 03:27.220
They will then be able

03:27.220 --> 03:28.180
to pincer Yunzhong Prefecture.

03:28.740 --> 03:29.500
By then, the State of Chu

03:29.740 --> 03:30.700
will inevitably plunge into chaos,

03:31.060 --> 03:32.260
allowing Xiao Xun to usurp the throne.

03:33.260 --> 03:33.700
Therefore,

03:34.380 --> 03:35.180
Wangcheng must not fall,

03:36.140 --> 03:36.860
and I shall not leave.

03:38.380 --> 03:38.980
Are you alright?

03:40.460 --> 03:41.100
Madam Ge,

03:41.700 --> 03:42.340
what brings you here?

03:46.820 --> 03:48.220
And who are you people?

03:48.740 --> 03:49.940
Wangcheng's gates
have been completely sealed

03:49.940 --> 03:50.540
by the Northern Desert's troops.

03:50.540 --> 03:51.860
How did you enter?

03:52.660 --> 03:54.500
This is Mr. Ge, Leader
of Cangmu Stronghold,

03:55.020 --> 03:55.900
and this is Madam Ge.

03:56.140 --> 03:56.700
Cangmu Stronghold?

03:57.740 --> 03:58.140
They're

03:58.980 --> 03:59.460
bandits?

03:59.780 --> 04:00.220
Yes.

04:02.780 --> 04:03.900
We broke in through the East Gate.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.060
There were roughly

04:05.540 --> 04:06.380
500 Northern Desert soldiers there.

04:09.580 --> 04:10.140
Madam Ge,

04:10.660 --> 04:11.420
you came at the perfect time.

04:12.100 --> 04:12.860
If you need anything,

04:13.460 --> 04:14.140
just say the word.

04:15.580 --> 04:16.780
Let's return to the yamen
for discussion.

04:25.020 --> 04:26.020
Did you tell her?

04:27.100 --> 04:27.980
Not a single word.

04:33.380 --> 04:33.860
Madam Ge,

04:34.540 --> 04:35.460
you have come

04:35.460 --> 04:36.180
to our aid once again.

04:36.580 --> 04:37.900
I am truly in your debt.

04:38.900 --> 04:40.500
To fight against the pursuers
from Xiaonan,

04:40.700 --> 04:41.660
we brought trouble upon you.

04:42.940 --> 04:44.100
Now, with Wangcheng in grave danger,

04:44.740 --> 04:45.780
we are dragging you into this yet again.

04:46.020 --> 04:47.220
You don't have to say that.

04:47.860 --> 04:49.420
Bandits as we are,

04:49.620 --> 04:50.900
we do have a sense of honor.

04:51.460 --> 04:52.300
With the enemy upon us,

04:52.500 --> 04:53.260
our fates are tied.

04:54.340 --> 04:55.580
My promise to you all

04:56.420 --> 04:57.140
stands forever.

04:58.180 --> 04:58.700
We will never forget it.

05:00.780 --> 05:01.820
Your Highness is quite right.

05:02.020 --> 05:02.780
I searched the city

05:02.860 --> 05:04.020
and discovered
over a dozen Northern Desert soldiers

05:04.300 --> 05:05.140
and some weapons.

05:05.740 --> 05:06.740
They have all been seized.

05:07.180 --> 05:08.300
Mr. Zhao, the defense map.

05:11.740 --> 05:13.340
The Northern Desert's troops advanced
through Xiaonan.

05:13.780 --> 05:15.300
Its mountain paths are treacherous,

05:15.660 --> 05:16.780
forcing them to travel light

05:17.100 --> 05:18.060
with their supplies and baggage.

05:18.820 --> 05:20.060
Therefore, compared to us,

05:20.820 --> 05:21.860
they will be far more agitated.

05:22.460 --> 05:22.820
Indeed.

05:23.260 --> 05:24.340
Just now on the city wall,

05:24.380 --> 05:26.580
the sound of the galloping
was indeed erratic.

05:26.900 --> 05:27.740
Thus, they are desperate

05:27.740 --> 05:28.580
to take Wangcheng.

05:29.260 --> 05:31.180
They need a stronghold to resupply,

05:31.780 --> 05:33.260
then launch a pincer attack on Yunzhong.

05:33.660 --> 05:34.900
If Xiao Xun leads

05:35.380 --> 05:36.460
the forces of Xiaonan Prefecture

05:36.820 --> 05:37.660
to reinforce the Northern Desert,

05:38.940 --> 05:39.820
what should we do?

05:41.060 --> 05:42.620
I know Xiao Xun.

05:43.660 --> 05:45.300
Since he wants to use
the Northern Desert as his weapon,

05:45.980 --> 05:47.260
he will wait
until the strike draws blood

05:47.260 --> 05:48.140
before coming into the light.

05:50.620 --> 05:52.820
He is waiting for their troops
to occupy Wangcheng.

05:53.380 --> 05:54.940
The troops' passage through Xiaonan

05:55.100 --> 05:56.420
is the very proof of his sincerity
to the Northern Desert.

05:56.780 --> 05:57.260
Therefore,

05:57.660 --> 05:59.300
his men will not make any move
for the time being.

05:59.740 --> 06:00.580
Three thousand

06:01.100 --> 06:01.900
against eight hundred.

06:02.580 --> 06:03.740
They still hold the upper hand.

06:04.980 --> 06:06.300
Wangcheng's defense resources
are limited.

06:06.900 --> 06:07.700
How are we to win?

06:08.340 --> 06:09.220
My father once said

06:09.900 --> 06:10.780
that fighting a war

06:11.140 --> 06:12.340
has never been
about who has more troops.

06:13.180 --> 06:14.740
Now, I'll let them see

06:15.020 --> 06:15.700
how the State of Chu

06:16.300 --> 06:17.580
defeats overwhelming odds.

06:18.020 --> 06:19.420
Well said, Your Highness.

06:19.980 --> 06:21.220
What plan do you have in mind?

06:21.820 --> 06:22.300
Jiu,

06:23.620 --> 06:24.540
have you scouted out

06:24.740 --> 06:25.980
the enemy's provisions and water supply?

06:31.220 --> 06:32.060
To the east of Wangcheng,

06:32.540 --> 06:33.300
there is a stream.

06:33.580 --> 06:34.700
That is their water supply.

06:35.460 --> 06:36.500
To the west

06:36.740 --> 06:37.780
lie their provisions.

06:38.380 --> 06:39.780
Their sentries are posted
only in the open.

06:40.980 --> 06:41.500
Mr. Zhao,

06:42.020 --> 06:43.540
are there any branches

06:43.820 --> 06:45.340
or gorges upstream?

06:46.260 --> 06:47.500
You want to cut off their water supply?

06:49.860 --> 06:51.300
There is a waterway five li
outside the city.

06:51.340 --> 06:52.980
It dries up every dry season.

06:53.740 --> 06:55.060
Diverting the water is feasible,

06:55.340 --> 06:57.140
but we cannot dispatch
laborers there right now.

06:57.260 --> 06:58.020
Leave this to me.

06:59.620 --> 07:00.460
What's your plan?

07:00.620 --> 07:01.180
Don't forget,

07:03.300 --> 07:04.260
we can use bone whistles

07:04.500 --> 07:06.340
to contact our people outside the city

07:06.500 --> 07:07.740
and have them take action

07:08.140 --> 07:08.940
at the waterway overnight.

07:09.300 --> 07:10.620
Then I'll leave that to you.

07:11.860 --> 07:12.660
You just mentioned

07:12.900 --> 07:13.740
a secret passage at the West Gate?

07:14.060 --> 07:14.540
The passage

07:15.500 --> 07:16.100
leads right to this place.

07:16.420 --> 07:17.900
However, it was built
during the late Emperor's reign

07:18.180 --> 07:19.060
and has long been abandoned.

07:20.220 --> 07:20.660
Jiu,

07:21.220 --> 07:22.700
you said that their provisions
are on the west side,

07:22.700 --> 07:23.140
right?

07:23.820 --> 07:24.300
Correct.

07:25.580 --> 07:27.180
Then even if it's an abandoned passage,

07:28.020 --> 07:29.220
we can still turn it to our advantage.

07:29.980 --> 07:30.460
Mr. Zhao,

07:30.780 --> 07:31.380
pass down the order.

07:31.940 --> 07:33.020
All citizens must shut their doors.

07:33.300 --> 07:34.340
Any contact with the outside city
is forbidden.

07:34.780 --> 07:35.140
Yes.

07:35.660 --> 07:36.100
Furthermore,

07:36.660 --> 07:38.060
move all defense resources
and provisions

07:38.820 --> 07:39.900
entirely to the South Gate.

07:40.740 --> 07:41.940
The enemy has the most troops
at the North Gate,

07:42.260 --> 07:43.340
yet you are stacking the resources

07:43.340 --> 07:44.260
at the South Gate instead?

07:46.020 --> 07:46.940
It's a diversion.

07:48.100 --> 07:48.580
Right.

07:49.380 --> 07:50.580
The city gates are all sealed.

07:50.700 --> 07:51.980
How are you going to pass the message

07:52.100 --> 07:54.060
to lure the enemy
into attacking the South Gate?

07:54.380 --> 07:56.140
With 3,000 troops besieging the city,

07:57.340 --> 07:59.820
they must assume the people inside
are panicked and wavering.

08:00.500 --> 08:01.420
If, at this moment,

08:01.860 --> 08:03.620
someone defects with our defense map,

08:04.660 --> 08:05.300
do you think

08:06.740 --> 08:07.620
they'll believe it?

08:08.500 --> 08:09.860
Desperate to breach the city,

08:10.060 --> 08:11.380
they won't be able to resist.

08:15.220 --> 08:15.540
But

08:15.820 --> 08:17.340
my act of cowardice

08:17.460 --> 08:18.940
won't fool them.

08:19.860 --> 08:20.340
I'll go.

08:27.060 --> 08:27.980
You're just a scout.

08:28.300 --> 08:29.380
How can you win the enemy's trust?

08:30.820 --> 08:32.100
Your Highness should know very well

08:33.060 --> 08:34.420
why I can win their trust,

08:35.140 --> 08:35.660
shouldn't you?

08:39.380 --> 08:40.540
It has little chance of survival.

08:40.980 --> 08:41.820
Have you thought it through?

08:42.660 --> 08:43.260
I have.

08:44.780 --> 08:45.580
But I have one condition.

08:45.660 --> 08:46.340
Insolent!

08:46.900 --> 08:47.660
With a formidable enemy upon us,

08:47.780 --> 08:49.060
how dare you propose conditions?

08:49.700 --> 08:50.700
I know what you want.

08:51.700 --> 08:52.500
If we win this battle

08:52.900 --> 08:53.700
and you come back alive,

08:54.060 --> 08:55.380
I will petition His Majesty
to grant you a title.

08:57.140 --> 08:58.580
Will the enemy truly believe

08:58.580 --> 08:59.860
the false intelligence he brings?

09:00.300 --> 09:00.700
No.

09:01.860 --> 09:03.020
What I want him to take

09:03.660 --> 09:04.860
is the real defense map.

09:07.700 --> 09:08.740
After all,

09:08.980 --> 09:10.300
I did move the provisions
to the South Gate.

09:11.500 --> 09:12.100
Nothing

09:12.580 --> 09:14.380
wins trust more easily

09:15.020 --> 09:16.220
than a lie woven with truth.

09:23.660 --> 09:24.180
Madam Ge,

09:24.580 --> 09:25.620
contact your men outside the city first.

09:26.380 --> 09:27.700
Once the enemy verifies

09:27.700 --> 09:28.940
the defense map brought by Liang Qiang,

09:29.300 --> 09:30.300
they will reinforce the South Gate.

09:30.700 --> 09:32.140
The defenses at the West Gate
will be weakened.

09:32.980 --> 09:33.420
Jiu,

09:33.740 --> 09:34.260
Mr. Ge,

09:34.420 --> 09:35.100
under the cover of night,

09:35.180 --> 09:36.340
leave the city by the secret passage,

09:36.620 --> 09:37.820
then burn their supplies

09:37.940 --> 09:38.780
and shatter their morale.

09:39.380 --> 09:39.940
Mr. Zhong,

09:40.180 --> 09:40.700
Madam Ge,

09:41.180 --> 09:42.100
watch for the fire as your signal.

09:42.540 --> 09:43.420
Once the enemy is in total chaos,

09:43.660 --> 09:44.700
lead our 800 elite soldiers out

09:44.780 --> 09:46.020
from the North Gate to smash them.

09:46.220 --> 09:47.580
Crush their main camp
in one fell swoop,

09:48.020 --> 09:49.380
then rout the scattered troops
one by one.

09:51.020 --> 09:51.620
- Understood. - Understood.

09:57.380 --> 09:58.180
This battle is perilous.

10:00.820 --> 10:02.580
Everyone, please be careful.

10:03.340 --> 10:03.980
- Yes. - Yes.

10:06.270 --> 10:08.550
[Northern Desert Vanguard Camp]

10:09.700 --> 10:10.180
General,

10:10.740 --> 10:11.540
should we launch the attack

10:11.540 --> 10:12.340
from the East and West Gates,

10:13.220 --> 10:13.900
and then lead the main force

10:14.460 --> 10:15.900
to crush the North Gate?

10:18.020 --> 10:18.500
Report.

10:18.740 --> 10:19.500
We captured a spy

10:19.540 --> 10:20.420
at the South Gate.

10:23.860 --> 10:24.380
General,

10:25.380 --> 10:27.020
I have come to present
Wangcheng's defense map.

10:43.540 --> 10:44.740
They have only 500 garrison troops,

10:45.180 --> 10:46.060
all with outdated equipment

10:46.460 --> 10:47.220
and a lack of training.

10:47.740 --> 10:48.900
The water supply east of Wangcheng

10:48.900 --> 10:49.580
has been cut off.

10:49.940 --> 10:51.620
It will dry up completely within a day.

10:53.540 --> 10:55.060
All the city's provisions
lie in the south.

10:55.740 --> 10:56.300
Right now,

10:56.500 --> 10:57.500
the defenses in the south
are at their weakest.

10:58.140 --> 10:59.260
Attacking from the South Gate

10:59.660 --> 11:00.780
will ensure a swift capture
of Wangcheng.

11:01.060 --> 11:02.100
Why would a turncoat

11:02.940 --> 11:03.780
like you help us?

11:10.260 --> 11:11.220
Because of a palace coup,

11:11.460 --> 11:12.300
my entire clan

11:12.940 --> 11:14.020
was unjustly exiled.

11:14.460 --> 11:15.860
The State of Chu treats me
like worthless chaff.

11:17.220 --> 11:18.660
Why should I remain loyal to it?

11:21.420 --> 11:23.140
Then what is your demand?

11:24.620 --> 11:25.740
If we successfully breach Wangcheng,

11:26.780 --> 11:27.620
I am willing to assist you, General,

11:28.500 --> 11:29.420
in attacking Yunzhong Prefecture,

11:30.540 --> 11:31.740
to replace Chu Ling.

11:52.380 --> 11:53.340
This is a diversion.

11:54.500 --> 11:55.620
You want to draw us

11:55.620 --> 11:56.580
to the South Gate, huh?

11:58.020 --> 11:59.500
Deceitful rat.

12:00.020 --> 12:00.740
You deserve to die!

12:01.020 --> 12:01.940
Report!

12:05.660 --> 12:06.060
General,

12:06.100 --> 12:06.660
the scouts report

12:06.860 --> 12:07.500
that Wangcheng's provisions

12:07.700 --> 12:08.700
are being moved to the South Gate.

12:16.140 --> 12:16.700
Take him down.

12:24.220 --> 12:26.060
Move half the troops from the East

12:26.060 --> 12:27.180
and West Gates to the South Gate,

12:27.620 --> 12:29.780
and breach the city immediately!

12:30.380 --> 12:30.980
- Yes! - Yes!

12:37.700 --> 12:41.060
[Wangcheng South Gate]

13:05.260 --> 13:06.220
Quick!

13:07.060 --> 13:08.060
Hold the gate!

13:21.020 --> 13:21.660
Stand fast!

13:21.860 --> 13:23.580
I will reward five liang to everyone!

13:38.740 --> 13:39.580
Hurry!

13:39.900 --> 13:40.940
Get over here!

13:40.940 --> 13:41.500
Quick!

13:41.820 --> 13:42.380
Hurry!

13:42.660 --> 13:43.420
Quick!

13:44.180 --> 13:44.860
Hold the gate!

13:46.620 --> 13:47.300
Brace yourselves!

13:52.260 --> 13:55.780
[Granary of Northern Desert
Vanguard Camp]

14:21.740 --> 14:22.140
General,

14:22.380 --> 14:23.100
the granary is on fire.

14:23.380 --> 14:24.580
The State of Chu has burned our granary!

14:24.780 --> 14:25.260
What?

14:27.380 --> 14:27.940
It's a trap!

14:28.540 --> 14:29.220
We've been duped!

14:30.260 --> 14:30.940
Hear my command!

14:31.500 --> 14:33.460
Tonight, we must burn the city
and seize their provisions!

14:33.780 --> 14:34.660
- Yes, General! - Yes, General!

14:36.740 --> 14:37.340
Kill!

14:41.980 --> 14:42.660
Soldiers!

14:42.900 --> 14:44.460
[Wangcheng North Gate]
Let's trample the enemy's camp!

14:44.700 --> 14:47.100
- Kill! - Kill!

15:15.980 --> 15:18.900
Report!

15:19.740 --> 15:20.180
Report.

15:20.660 --> 15:21.380
The Northern Desert has retreated.

15:21.460 --> 15:22.500
We slaughtered 2,000 of their men,​​

15:22.540 --> 15:23.540
though at the cost of 300 of our own.

15:23.980 --> 15:25.220
General Zhong has led
the troops back to the city.

15:25.540 --> 15:25.940
Good.

15:26.340 --> 15:26.940
Magnificent.

15:28.980 --> 15:29.660
Where is Xie Yanlai?

15:30.660 --> 15:31.420
There is no word yet.

16:05.220 --> 16:05.900
Hurry up.

17:01.540 --> 17:05.660
♪Light shatters into silhouettes♪

17:06.660 --> 17:12.420
♪A lingering mark on my palm♪

17:13.180 --> 17:18.420
♪Hooves thunder
through the ashes of war♪

17:18.420 --> 17:23.860
♪Riding the wild wind
straight into the dawn♪

17:25.940 --> 17:28.300
♪A vivid life♪

17:28.740 --> 17:30.980
♪Bathed in tears♪

17:31.660 --> 17:34.660
♪Surging toward the dawn♪

17:35.500 --> 17:40.100
♪Let it burn until there's nothing left♪

17:40.620 --> 17:43.140
♪We crown our pain like glory♪

17:43.420 --> 17:46.220
♪Give that long-held wish a chance♪

17:47.140 --> 17:51.700
♪Let's run straight into the ruins♪

17:52.020 --> 17:55.100
♪I'd spend the rest of my life with you♪

17:55.100 --> 17:58.020
♪Even if longing turns to ash♪

17:58.020 --> 18:00.100
♪I'd still feel no fear♪

18:05.100 --> 18:10.220
♪You are the hope
I sowed in bleakest dark♪

18:10.220 --> 18:14.700
♪Where a sharp blade
rises from the dust♪

18:14.700 --> 18:15.540
I promised

18:17.420 --> 18:18.340
I'd come back alive.

18:18.340 --> 18:20.300
♪A vivid life♪

18:20.740 --> 18:22.820
♪Bathed in tears♪

18:23.580 --> 18:26.060
♪Surging toward the dawn♪

18:27.580 --> 18:32.180
♪Let it burn until there's nothing left♪

18:32.700 --> 18:35.220
♪We crown our pain like glory♪

18:35.500 --> 18:38.260
♪Give that long-held wish a chance♪

18:38.860 --> 18:40.100
Victory at Wangcheng!​​

18:40.540 --> 18:42.820
The Grand Princess crushes
the Northern Desert invaders!​

18:44.100 --> 18:45.500
Victory at Wangcheng!​​

18:46.100 --> 18:48.540
The Grand Princess crushes
the Northern Desert invaders!​

18:49.660 --> 18:51.180
Victory at Wangcheng!​​

18:51.860 --> 18:54.540
The Grand Princess crushes
the Northern Desert invaders!​

18:55.460 --> 18:57.020
Victory at Wangcheng!​​

18:57.420 --> 19:00.300
The Grand Princess crushes
the Northern Desert invaders!​

19:00.500 --> 19:01.420
Miss Tang,

19:01.940 --> 19:03.140
what is going on?

19:03.460 --> 19:04.340
Why did Her Highness suddenly go

19:04.340 --> 19:05.140
to the frontier?

19:05.580 --> 19:06.340
This has been weighing

19:06.580 --> 19:07.860
on my heart for a long time.

19:08.060 --> 19:08.540
Today,

19:08.580 --> 19:09.580
I can finally speak of it.

19:10.020 --> 19:10.820
Do you know

19:11.060 --> 19:12.020
what Her Highness was doing

19:12.100 --> 19:13.980
while the entire Capital

19:14.060 --> 19:15.140
was cursing my uncle

19:15.420 --> 19:16.100
for incompetent leadership

19:16.540 --> 19:17.260
and being too cowardly to advance?

19:18.220 --> 19:19.020
What was she doing?

19:19.980 --> 19:21.540
She rode a vast distance

19:21.780 --> 19:22.620
to save Wangcheng,

19:22.860 --> 19:24.100
crushing the Northern Desert's troops.

19:24.620 --> 19:25.740
Crushing the Northern Desert's troops?

19:25.860 --> 19:27.020
This is what the Chu clan does.

19:27.500 --> 19:28.460
We defend the nation,

19:28.660 --> 19:29.820
heedless of blame or death.

19:30.300 --> 19:31.060
We do not speak of it.

19:32.340 --> 19:33.180
We act.

19:33.460 --> 19:34.020
No.

19:34.620 --> 19:35.740
You cannot stay silent anymore.

19:36.260 --> 19:37.860
You bore it all

19:38.460 --> 19:39.420
when General Chu was slandered.

19:39.820 --> 19:40.820
But now, Her Highness

19:40.900 --> 19:41.980
has achieved a glorious victory.

19:42.340 --> 19:43.540
She must not be forgotten.​

19:44.460 --> 19:44.940
Tang,

19:45.380 --> 19:46.100
host a banquet at the Chu Mansion

19:46.260 --> 19:46.940
and send out the invitations.

19:47.100 --> 19:48.140
Let everyone in the Capital come

19:48.220 --> 19:49.500
to praise Her Highness.

19:51.140 --> 19:52.460
And let those who love

19:52.540 --> 19:54.060
to gossip behind her back

19:54.540 --> 19:55.740
take a good look

19:56.100 --> 19:57.060
at what kind of extraordinary figure

19:57.420 --> 19:58.540
Her Highness truly is.

19:59.300 --> 20:00.180
I will head back right now

20:00.300 --> 20:01.260
and have my father write
a memorial of congratulation.

20:01.380 --> 20:02.940
What's wrong with you?

20:03.060 --> 20:04.380
She deserves a congratulatory memorial.

20:04.820 --> 20:06.220
She is the Grand Princess, after all.

20:06.620 --> 20:07.300
Yes, a congratulatory memorial.

20:07.380 --> 20:07.860
Indeed.

20:08.460 --> 20:08.940
Let's go.

20:09.860 --> 20:10.860
My princess.

20:12.060 --> 20:13.100
You do not fight for fame,

20:13.980 --> 20:15.060
but you will have

20:15.860 --> 20:16.740
every bit of the glory you deserve.

20:18.060 --> 20:18.580
Your Majesty,

20:19.300 --> 20:20.900
this morning,
a top-urgent dispatch arrived.

20:21.180 --> 20:23.060
It reports that Her Highness
has relieved the siege of Wangcheng

20:23.300 --> 20:24.860
and crushed the Northern Desert forces.

20:25.860 --> 20:27.660
Her Highness absented herself
on the pretext of illness,

20:27.940 --> 20:29.980
yet she violated palace decrees
by fleeing

20:30.540 --> 20:32.180
to fight at the frontier.

20:32.500 --> 20:33.980
This is sheer absurdity.

20:34.540 --> 20:37.420
Mr. Deng and Mr. Xie serve
as imperial councilors.

20:37.780 --> 20:39.500
To permit such misconduct
is a dereliction of duty.

20:39.740 --> 20:40.260
They ought to...

20:40.380 --> 20:41.580
Ought to what?

20:43.940 --> 20:45.140
Ministers, may I remind you

20:46.100 --> 20:47.620
His Majesty was saved
by none other than Her Highness,

20:47.620 --> 20:50.060
who rode into battle to slay the rebels?

20:50.420 --> 20:52.380
Her Highness
privately mobilized the army.

20:52.580 --> 20:54.540
What does she take the laws ​to be​?

20:54.780 --> 20:55.940
As Regent,

20:55.940 --> 20:57.460
how could you allow this indulgence?

20:58.300 --> 20:58.900
Indulgence?

20:59.860 --> 21:01.860
I would ask you all instead.

21:02.900 --> 21:04.060
Who was it

21:04.620 --> 21:05.900
who stood in this very court

21:05.940 --> 21:07.580
and vehemently denounced

21:07.620 --> 21:09.020
the incompetence of the Guard General?

21:09.740 --> 21:10.500
And who was it

21:11.260 --> 21:13.860
who petitioned daily for reinforcements?

21:14.660 --> 21:16.940
Now that Her Highness has lifted
the siege on the frontier,

21:18.300 --> 21:20.060
you are suddenly displeased.

21:20.460 --> 21:20.980
Preposterous!

21:21.500 --> 21:23.020
Since when has the State of Chu

21:23.020 --> 21:24.700
relied upon women to lead armies?

21:25.380 --> 21:26.300
If

21:26.300 --> 21:27.540
we have truly come to such a pass,

21:27.940 --> 21:29.260
though old and frail,

21:29.460 --> 21:31.060
I would gladly march to my death.

21:33.140 --> 21:34.460
When His Majesty
first ascended the throne,

21:35.020 --> 21:36.180
it was Her Highness

21:36.300 --> 21:37.860
who slew the traitors to protect him.

21:38.460 --> 21:39.340
By that right alone,

21:39.340 --> 21:41.020
she may defend the frontier.

21:42.460 --> 21:44.860
If you are truly devoted to the state,

21:45.300 --> 21:46.780
you are welcome to depart immediately

21:46.780 --> 21:47.620
for the frontier.

21:48.180 --> 21:49.060
Mr. Deng and I

21:49.620 --> 21:50.620
shall certainly not hinder you.

21:50.780 --> 21:51.100
You...

21:51.820 --> 21:52.180
You...

21:52.660 --> 21:54.260
Please calm your wrath.

21:55.100 --> 21:56.700
It was merely a suggestion.

21:59.220 --> 22:00.300
Ministers,

22:01.060 --> 22:02.220
lend ear to my words.

22:03.340 --> 22:05.020
I owe my survival in troubled times

22:05.620 --> 22:06.900
to the Grand Princess's protection.

22:07.500 --> 22:09.820
She is the daughter
of Guard General Chu Ling.

22:10.580 --> 22:11.700
Though a woman,

22:12.540 --> 22:13.740
she is valiant and skilled in warfare.

22:14.380 --> 22:15.540
Thus, my grandfather

22:15.620 --> 22:17.580
bestowed upon her
as Grand Princess of State

22:18.180 --> 22:19.900
so she might continue to safeguard

22:20.020 --> 22:20.820
my security.

22:21.580 --> 22:22.740
As the Son of Heaven,

22:23.100 --> 22:24.140
I preside over the imperial city,

22:24.660 --> 22:26.100
unable to go to the frontier

22:26.540 --> 22:27.580
to save the state
and protect the people.

22:28.220 --> 22:29.020
Therefore, I requested

22:29.380 --> 22:31.060
the Grand Princess to go to the frontier

22:31.660 --> 22:33.140
to relieve my burden.

22:38.620 --> 22:40.020
This is no absurdity.

22:40.700 --> 22:41.980
It was the late Emperor's decree.

22:42.900 --> 22:44.580
Let no official presume
to speculate further.

22:45.380 --> 22:46.420
The Grand Princess leaving the palace

22:46.940 --> 22:47.980
was by my command.

22:48.540 --> 22:49.540
However,

22:50.980 --> 22:51.820
how did 3,000 Northern Desert soldiers

22:51.820 --> 22:53.380
suddenly appear at Wangcheng?

22:54.100 --> 22:55.300
They bypassed our entire frontier

22:55.660 --> 22:56.580
and pressed straight to the city walls.

22:57.220 --> 22:57.740
Mr. Deng.

22:58.300 --> 22:58.980
Yes, Your Majesty.

22:59.380 --> 23:00.900
​Order the Ministry of War
to investigate.

23:01.420 --> 23:02.540
From whence

23:02.660 --> 23:03.900
did these soldiers come?

23:04.500 --> 23:06.340
Is it a lapse in our frontier defenses,

23:07.020 --> 23:07.860
or...?

23:09.820 --> 23:11.220
This matter must be accounted for

23:11.220 --> 23:11.940
to the fallen soldiers.

23:12.460 --> 23:14.460
Yes, Your Majesty.

23:15.540 --> 23:17.100
Let there be no further debate
or censure on this matter.

23:17.580 --> 23:18.620
The Grand Princess's great victory

23:18.940 --> 23:20.180
is a joyous occasion for the state.

23:20.900 --> 23:21.540
It warrants celebration.

23:21.820 --> 23:24.180
- Congratulations to Your Majesty,
- Congratulations to Your Majesty,

23:24.260 --> 23:26.700
- and to Her Highness.
- and to Her Highness.

23:30.780 --> 23:31.380
Zhao,

23:33.260 --> 23:33.700
finally,

23:35.260 --> 23:36.380
I can protect you.

23:38.600 --> 23:40.600
[Grand Mentor's Residence]

23:41.900 --> 23:42.860
​Zhao won the highest merit​

23:43.220 --> 23:44.380
​in the great victory at Wangcheng.​

23:45.020 --> 23:45.860
I will surely hold my head high

23:45.860 --> 23:47.660
before Mr. Deng.

23:48.540 --> 23:49.500
​Even so,​​

23:50.220 --> 23:51.660
​I showed disrespect to him before.​​

23:52.060 --> 23:53.700
​It would not be surprising
if he took offense.​

23:54.700 --> 23:55.460
According to Zhao,​​

23:55.700 --> 23:56.900
​he's a sly fox,​​

23:57.180 --> 23:58.220
​but a dutiful son.​

23:59.060 --> 24:00.340
Currying favor with his mother

24:00.700 --> 24:02.300
is the best way to win him over.

24:03.020 --> 24:04.460
Miss Tang,
to what do I owe the pleasure?​

24:05.460 --> 24:06.700
Did you come

24:06.700 --> 24:07.420
because of Her Highness's victory,

24:07.860 --> 24:09.260
just to gloat before my eyes?

24:10.780 --> 24:11.620
Not at all.

24:12.180 --> 24:13.220
​I heard

24:13.460 --> 24:14.900
your mother has had a persistent cough,​

24:15.380 --> 24:16.700
​so I brought some Chuanbei.

24:18.420 --> 24:19.620
​Zhao told me.​​

24:26.380 --> 24:28.260
​Is that Miss Chu?​

24:28.780 --> 24:29.220
Mother.

24:29.940 --> 24:30.380
Yi.

24:30.700 --> 24:31.140
Easy.

24:32.860 --> 24:33.220
Here.

24:33.780 --> 24:36.500
​I had the millet you sent

24:37.180 --> 24:38.820
simmered into congee by the servants.​

24:39.140 --> 24:41.180
Paired with some pickled vegetables,

24:42.180 --> 24:43.900
it truly tastes like my hometown.

24:44.260 --> 24:44.860
Old Madam,

24:45.100 --> 24:46.660
I am Chu...

24:46.660 --> 24:47.380
I know.

24:47.700 --> 24:48.660
Chu Zhao.

24:50.100 --> 24:50.700
Yi.

24:50.940 --> 24:51.340
Mother.

24:51.660 --> 24:52.300
Miss Chu

24:52.300 --> 24:54.220
​came here again and again with gifts.

24:54.300 --> 24:56.340
How could you not even offer
a cup of tea?​

24:56.580 --> 24:57.060
Mother,​​

24:58.020 --> 24:58.980
​this is Chu Tang,​​

24:59.260 --> 25:00.020
​not Chu Zhao.​​

25:00.860 --> 25:01.660
​Old Madam,​​

25:02.140 --> 25:03.460
​I am Zhao's elder cousin.​​

25:03.860 --> 25:04.740
​My name is Chu Tang.​

25:05.260 --> 25:05.660
Chu...

25:05.740 --> 25:06.420
I came specifically

25:06.780 --> 25:07.980
to pay my respects to you.​

25:08.140 --> 25:09.340
Help the Old Madam back
for her medicine.​

25:09.900 --> 25:10.380
Go.

25:10.940 --> 25:11.380
Mother,

25:11.820 --> 25:12.660
​it is time you took your medicine.​

25:13.060 --> 25:13.900
Alright.

25:14.860 --> 25:17.140
The young ladies of the Chu Family
are both good girls.

25:17.700 --> 25:18.740
Do not miss this opportunity.

25:20.900 --> 25:21.540
Miss Chu,​​

25:21.780 --> 25:22.540
​do visit again.

25:24.060 --> 25:25.420
They are both good girls.

25:26.060 --> 25:26.580
Good girls.

25:29.140 --> 25:30.100
Old Madam

25:31.060 --> 25:32.620
must have misunderstood something.​

25:32.900 --> 25:33.580
My mother​

25:34.500 --> 25:35.780
​is sometimes a bit confused.​

25:36.460 --> 25:36.900
My apologies.​​

25:37.340 --> 25:38.540
​Since the gifts have been delivered,​​

25:38.860 --> 25:40.100
​I shall not intrude any further.​​

25:40.540 --> 25:41.060
​Farewell.​

25:54.220 --> 25:54.860
Zhao

25:55.980 --> 25:57.500
has foiled my plans once again.

25:58.180 --> 25:58.940
After this battle,

25:59.300 --> 26:00.020
the Northern Desert King

26:00.020 --> 26:01.140
lost over 2,500 men.

26:01.380 --> 26:02.100
The surviving soldiers

26:02.300 --> 26:03.340
seek passage through Xiaonan Prefecture

26:03.620 --> 26:04.300
to return to the Northern Desert.

26:07.140 --> 26:08.340
Since they have been defeated,

26:10.340 --> 26:11.420
those survivors

26:11.420 --> 26:12.500
need not go back.

26:14.220 --> 26:15.660
Your Highness, you mean...?

26:17.220 --> 26:18.660
Slaughter every last one

26:19.620 --> 26:20.660
of them.

26:21.900 --> 26:23.300
The court wishes to investigate?

26:24.740 --> 26:25.380
Then we'll let them find

26:25.380 --> 26:26.620
nothing but dead ends.

26:27.540 --> 26:28.300
Should the Northern Desert King learn

26:28.300 --> 26:29.420
our hand was behind this...

26:29.700 --> 26:30.980
Dead men tell no tales.

26:32.620 --> 26:33.300
Those remnants

26:34.060 --> 26:36.380
may not survive the journey back.

26:37.540 --> 26:38.780
And even if some escape,

26:41.220 --> 26:42.220
who could prove

26:42.220 --> 26:43.620
it was our doing?

26:45.740 --> 26:46.140
Yes.

26:59.620 --> 27:00.660
Zhao,

27:02.780 --> 27:03.500
you trampled

27:03.500 --> 27:05.300
upon my heart.

27:07.500 --> 27:08.660
Then do not blame me

27:10.900 --> 27:13.020
for showing you no mercy hereafter.

27:14.580 --> 27:15.140
Mr. Xie,

27:15.660 --> 27:16.420
Her Highness has dispatched riders

27:16.420 --> 27:17.780
to report the victory at Wangcheng

27:17.780 --> 27:19.140
back to the Capital with all haste.

27:19.700 --> 27:21.020
It seems her ambitions run deep.

27:22.940 --> 27:24.580
All of this is fact,

27:25.300 --> 27:26.460
with not a word of exaggeration.

27:28.340 --> 27:29.140
It was she

27:29.140 --> 27:30.700
who led the troops and routed
the Northern Desert's forces,

27:31.260 --> 27:32.660
delivering the people of Wangcheng.

27:33.260 --> 27:34.220
A merit this great

27:34.540 --> 27:35.780
deserves to be proclaimed far and wide.

27:37.340 --> 27:38.780
It would settle the hearts of the people

27:39.420 --> 27:40.540
and bring stability to the realm.

27:41.180 --> 27:42.300
Were she a man,

27:42.700 --> 27:43.820
there would be nothing wrong with this.

27:44.660 --> 27:45.540
Were she a general,

27:45.540 --> 27:46.500
even if it was Chu Ling,

27:46.820 --> 27:48.100
there would be nothing wrong
with it either.

27:48.700 --> 27:49.420
But she is

27:50.780 --> 27:52.140
a woman.

27:52.620 --> 27:53.220
And now that

27:53.220 --> 27:54.220
she has become the Grand Princess,

27:54.980 --> 27:56.140
should she not remain in the Capital,

27:56.260 --> 27:57.620
living out her days

27:57.620 --> 27:58.700
in virtuous nobility?

27:59.140 --> 28:00.940
Why must she seek such glory
on the battlefield?

28:01.660 --> 28:03.060
She ​rules alongside​ His Majesty

28:03.780 --> 28:05.220
and attends the court with His Majesty.

28:05.620 --> 28:06.660
At every turn, she stands

28:06.660 --> 28:07.500
before the ministers.

28:08.140 --> 28:09.140
And now, she intends to stand

28:09.140 --> 28:10.060
before the whole world.

28:10.460 --> 28:10.940
Clearly,

28:11.420 --> 28:12.740
she refuses to know her place,

28:13.260 --> 28:14.540
and means to usurp the throne.

28:14.860 --> 28:15.460
She's obviously

28:15.580 --> 28:16.060
taking advantage of

28:16.060 --> 28:17.140
Yu's age.

28:17.660 --> 28:19.140
What is there to be vexed about?

28:20.580 --> 28:21.460
What she guards with her life

28:21.460 --> 28:22.620
is Yu's state.

28:23.820 --> 28:24.420
Technically,

28:24.420 --> 28:25.780
I'm her uncle, too.

28:26.740 --> 28:27.860
We're family,

28:28.820 --> 28:29.380
right?

28:34.620 --> 28:35.900
Yanlai was right, though.

28:38.620 --> 28:40.020
She's sharper

28:43.540 --> 28:45.340
than I imagined.

29:24.740 --> 29:26.060
In defense of Wangcheng,

29:27.700 --> 29:28.860
800 soldiers marched out,

29:30.460 --> 29:31.660
but barely 500 returned.

29:33.660 --> 29:36.220
Yet the tens of thousands of its people

29:37.220 --> 29:38.060
survived.

29:41.260 --> 29:43.300
​Behind every fallen soldier​

29:46.260 --> 29:48.100
​are children
waiting for their fathers,​​

29:50.020 --> 29:51.780
​aging mothers straining
for a glimpse of their sons,​​

29:54.980 --> 29:56.140
​and wives aching

29:57.180 --> 29:58.260
for their husbands.​

30:01.740 --> 30:03.140
But they are never coming back.

30:10.140 --> 30:11.220
Your father once told me

30:14.660 --> 30:15.380
that we wage war

30:18.060 --> 30:19.180
only so that more people

30:19.180 --> 30:19.860
may live.

30:21.540 --> 30:22.820
I, too, once sought death,

30:26.180 --> 30:27.220
but it was he who showed me

30:27.460 --> 30:28.540
the purpose of staying alive.

30:30.340 --> 30:31.060
The living

30:32.460 --> 30:33.620
will greet a better tomorrow,

30:35.620 --> 30:36.740
but they will forever remember

30:36.740 --> 30:37.740
those who fell.

30:39.300 --> 30:39.740
This is

30:41.780 --> 30:43.180
the meaning of their sacrifice.

30:55.940 --> 30:56.780
​Their deaths​

30:59.420 --> 31:00.420
​are the fault of war

31:01.740 --> 31:02.740
and of these chaotic times.​​

31:07.180 --> 31:08.140
Not yours.​

31:13.740 --> 31:14.220
Zhao.

31:42.140 --> 31:42.940
In broad daylight,

31:43.220 --> 31:44.260
how can you lynch him?

31:52.060 --> 31:53.380
They're killing him casually!

31:53.620 --> 31:54.260
Zhao,

31:54.500 --> 31:55.300
be good.

31:57.780 --> 31:58.740
Perhaps you don't know

31:59.740 --> 32:00.660
what your name

32:00.660 --> 32:01.260
means to me.

32:02.860 --> 32:04.340
But just as dawn
always drives away the night,

32:05.820 --> 32:06.420
you saved

32:08.060 --> 32:08.860
me.

32:13.260 --> 32:14.380
After you left,

32:15.700 --> 32:17.460
I kept searching for you
wherever your trail led.

32:18.740 --> 32:19.460
Back then, I thought...

32:20.380 --> 32:21.340
if I couldn't survive,

32:22.260 --> 32:23.780
dying where you were

32:24.380 --> 32:25.100
wouldn't be so bad.

32:34.260 --> 32:35.380
So, that young man...

32:38.700 --> 32:39.580
was you.

32:41.340 --> 32:41.940
Yes.

32:53.780 --> 32:54.340
Zhao.

32:57.500 --> 32:58.140
You were the one

33:01.220 --> 33:02.580
who pulled me

33:02.580 --> 33:03.860
out of the abyss.

33:05.740 --> 33:06.380
​It was you​

33:09.020 --> 33:10.580
​who gave me a reason to live.​

33:14.940 --> 33:16.340
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

33:16.340 --> 33:17.620
You always asked me

33:20.700 --> 33:22.100
why I kept saying I owed you.

33:25.180 --> 33:25.620
This is...

33:27.860 --> 33:28.580
the reason.

33:30.220 --> 33:32.540
♪Through biting winds and frost I go♪

33:32.860 --> 33:35.300
♪I light a lamp, my lone abode♪

33:35.900 --> 33:37.300
♪Half my life adrift♪

33:37.700 --> 33:41.580
♪This lonely shadow
finds no haven to moor♪

33:43.340 --> 33:44.100
So...

33:44.100 --> 33:45.900
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

33:46.140 --> 33:47.380
♪And roars in the blaze♪

33:47.380 --> 33:48.380
From now on,​

33:49.340 --> 33:50.020
my life...

33:50.020 --> 33:51.260
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

33:52.620 --> 33:53.380
is yours.

33:53.700 --> 33:58.420
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

33:58.660 --> 34:02.980
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

34:02.980 --> 34:07.180
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

34:07.180 --> 34:12.540
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

34:12.740 --> 34:14.420
♪With no fear of the distance♪

34:14.420 --> 34:18.420
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

34:18.660 --> 34:22.700
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

34:23.300 --> 34:27.820
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

34:28.140 --> 34:31.020
♪My new pride♪

34:45.380 --> 34:46.580
Your merits are reported,

34:47.220 --> 34:49.140
your name has been cleared,

34:49.660 --> 34:51.100
and rewards will follow.

35:00.700 --> 35:01.500
How is the situation outside the city?

35:02.260 --> 35:02.820
Your Highness,

35:03.420 --> 35:04.260
the remnants are cleared.

35:04.740 --> 35:05.900
Three Northern Desert maps are seized.​​

35:16.020 --> 35:16.780
​Wangcheng wouldn't have held​

35:17.260 --> 35:18.060
​without your efforts.​

35:18.620 --> 35:19.220
General Zhong

35:19.580 --> 35:20.580
has transferred me
to the Vanguard Battalion.

35:21.100 --> 35:21.900
I am immensely grateful.

35:23.380 --> 35:24.340
The Wei Village?

35:26.300 --> 35:27.420
What is the meaning of this marking?

35:28.740 --> 35:29.460
I do not know.

35:30.540 --> 35:32.340
But since the Northern Desert scouts
made this mark,

35:32.940 --> 35:33.860
it stands to reason that this village

35:34.380 --> 35:35.260
must hold some significance.

35:37.980 --> 35:40.020
​That name sounds familiar.​

35:49.120 --> 35:52.050
[Wei Village]

35:55.660 --> 35:57.620
Help!

35:58.020 --> 36:00.580
Please help us!

36:01.300 --> 36:04.820
Someone help!

36:05.940 --> 36:08.940
Please, save us!

36:12.380 --> 36:14.540
Is anyone there?

36:15.140 --> 36:18.020
Help!

36:45.340 --> 36:46.140
​Leaving already?​​

36:47.780 --> 36:48.780
​I'm no soldier.​

36:49.380 --> 36:50.100
Guarding the city

36:50.580 --> 36:51.220
is not my job.

36:54.860 --> 36:55.540
Take good care

36:56.580 --> 36:57.260
of her, will you?

36:57.740 --> 36:58.340
Of course I will.

36:58.780 --> 36:59.380
I've watched her

36:59.580 --> 37:00.980
grow up.

37:06.540 --> 37:07.180
Is he doing well?

37:09.020 --> 37:09.500
He's alive.

37:16.380 --> 37:17.260
​If he passes away,​

37:19.060 --> 37:19.860
​send for me at once.​

37:20.500 --> 37:21.300
Are you leaving?

37:26.500 --> 37:27.900
I owe you a great debt
for your aid this time.

37:28.340 --> 37:29.300
I was hoping you might return

37:29.580 --> 37:30.820
with us to Yunzhong Prefecture.

37:31.820 --> 37:32.260
No.

37:33.140 --> 37:34.220
I have been away
from the stronghold too long.

37:35.020 --> 37:35.700
It is time I returned.

37:47.180 --> 37:48.100
If you need me ever again,

37:49.580 --> 37:50.820
send word to Cangmu Stronghold.

38:10.300 --> 38:11.060
I believe

38:11.980 --> 38:12.660
​it all depends

38:12.940 --> 38:14.580
on the situation in Wangcheng.​

38:48.380 --> 38:49.140
​Report!​​

38:50.700 --> 38:52.100
General, a great victory at Wangcheng!

38:52.260 --> 38:53.060
​Her Highness led the army​

38:53.100 --> 38:54.140
​and drove back
the Northern Desert vanguard.​​

38:54.300 --> 38:55.100
​Over a thousand enemies slain.​

38:55.660 --> 38:56.700
A strong father raises no weak daughter.

38:57.100 --> 38:58.340
Present the dispatch.​​

39:01.700 --> 39:02.140
​General,​​

39:02.740 --> 39:03.700
Her Highness fought

39:03.860 --> 39:04.500
a glorious battle.

39:05.420 --> 39:06.660
We should welcome her return in triumph.

39:07.260 --> 39:08.100
She has brought

39:08.420 --> 39:09.260
such honor to us.

39:09.580 --> 39:10.620
​Indeed.​

39:10.940 --> 39:11.380
General,​​

39:11.740 --> 39:13.020
​Her Highness's arrival
at Yunzhong Prefecture

39:13.420 --> 39:14.460
​is a great boost to morale.​

39:14.620 --> 39:16.100
I will ready the ceremonial guard
right now.

39:16.220 --> 39:16.660
Exactly.

39:16.900 --> 39:17.420
No need.

39:19.420 --> 39:20.740
The one returning

39:21.460 --> 39:22.460
is not the Grand Princess,

39:24.340 --> 39:25.220
but my daughter,

39:26.500 --> 39:27.100
Zhao.

39:28.300 --> 39:29.540
I am willing to lead the light cavalry

39:29.620 --> 39:31.260
to escort Miss Zhao back.

39:31.460 --> 39:33.260
She knows the roads
better than any of you.

39:34.460 --> 39:35.780
Go and rest your troops.

39:37.180 --> 39:38.260
Do not delay
the greater matters at hand.

39:39.620 --> 39:40.340
You may withdraw.​​

39:41.940 --> 39:42.620
- ​Yes! - ​Yes!

40:40.220 --> 40:42.260
​I really wish I could see you.

40:45.820 --> 40:47.220
Zhao.

40:52.100 --> 40:56.700
♪Broken walls and withered branches,
trapped in the mire♪

40:56.980 --> 40:59.460
♪Yet still striving
to reach for the sky♪

40:59.500 --> 41:03.540
♪My pride is torn down
and my body is sacrificed♪

41:05.780 --> 41:07.900
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

41:07.980 --> 41:09.940
♪And roars in the blaze♪

41:10.020 --> 41:13.260
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

41:13.420 --> 41:15.660
♪Fate imprisons me♪

41:15.820 --> 41:20.620
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

41:20.620 --> 41:24.820
♪Even if hope is faint,
I remain proud♪

41:24.820 --> 41:29.100
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean,
however long it takes♪

41:29.100 --> 41:34.540
♪However it ends up,
I'll go my own way♪

41:34.540 --> 41:36.500
♪With no fear of the distance♪

41:36.500 --> 41:40.220
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

41:40.220 --> 41:44.660
♪With sword in hand,
I'll pierce the dawn♪

41:44.660 --> 41:50.020
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

41:50.020 --> 41:53.620
♪My new pride♪

42:08.420 --> 42:11.300
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

42:11.300 --> 42:13.820
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

42:13.820 --> 42:16.180
♪Amidst the chaos♪

42:16.180 --> 42:20.460
♪I'll always be with you♪

42:21.900 --> 42:24.020
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

42:24.100 --> 42:26.060
♪And roars in the blaze♪

42:26.140 --> 42:29.380
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

